  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 8_ 7 _ 6_ 3 = 19\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the blanks :\n\nOption 1) -, +, × \n\n8_ 7 _ 6_ 3 = 19 ⇒ 8 - 7 + 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 8 - 7 + __**6 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**8 + 18**__ - 7 = 19\n\n⇒ __**26 - 7**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 19 = 19 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) -, -, ×\n\n8_ 7 _ 6_ 3 = 19 ⇒ 8 - 7 - 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 8 - 7 - __**6 × 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**8 - 7 - 18**__ = 19\n\n⇒ -17 ≠ 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) -, ÷ , ×\n\n8_ 7 _ 6_ 3 = 19 ⇒ 8 - 7 ÷ 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 8 - __**7 ÷ 6**__ × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 8 - __**1.17 × 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**8 - 3.5**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 4.5 ≠ 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) +, +, × \n\n8_ 7 _ 6_ 3 = 19 ⇒ 8 + 7 + 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 8 + 7 + __**6 × 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**8 + 7 + 18**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 33 ≠ 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
